        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Moon, Space Cadet! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Roving Rovers</i> is a cozy exploration and <strong>resource management</strong> game where you pilot your very own lunar rover! With humanity's arrival on the horizon, you have to explore the moon's surface to find useful resources to ensure the moon is fit for human inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447240/extras/9e5fd1f4ff12dbc182da80c94a33c7e9.poster.avif?t=1787203702\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447240/extras/9e5fd1f4ff12dbc182da80c94a33c7e9.webm?t=1787203702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447240/extras/9e5fd1f4ff12dbc182da80c94a33c7e9.mp4?t=1787203702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will traverse across imported scans of the moon's surface, meaning the craters, rocks and ridges that you drive over are based on a genuine lunar landscape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customisable Rovers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across the moon in style, and own it! Your little rover is customisable, so make it your own to suit your taste. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447240/extras/5b2b748944b77ae878848ab9529751e8.poster.avif?t=1787203702\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447240/extras/5b2b748944b77ae878848ab9529751e8.webm?t=1787203702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447240/extras/5b2b748944b77ae878848ab9529751e8.mp4?t=1787203702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll need to collect and gather resources while exploring and completing missions. Every resource brings you one step closer to figuring out if the moon is going to be humanity's new home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447240/extras/d41cf034313078e41aebe768a3559b15.poster.avif?t=1787203702\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447240/extras/d41cf034313078e41aebe768a3559b15.webm?t=1787203702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447240/extras/d41cf034313078e41aebe768a3559b15.mp4?t=1787203702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration Is Key</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the Lunar landscape, and sink into the cosmic environment as you explore! Don’t leave any stone unturned, or any crater overlooked, important resources or information could be waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447240/extras/51d2118e4340d2700489e5da04effa91.poster.avif?t=1787203702\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447240/extras/51d2118e4340d2700489e5da04effa91.webm?t=1787203702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447240/extras/51d2118e4340d2700489e5da04effa91.mp4?t=1787203702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feature Summary:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep <strong>resource management</strong> systems that reward planning and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>customisable rover;</strong> parts, paint, and personality!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying <strong>collecting and gathering resources</strong> loops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-ended <strong>exploration</strong> across a vast lunar map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roving Rovers started as a replica of the internationally recognised Australian Rover Challenge, enabling players to understand the complexities of the lunar and otherworldly rover missions. Developed with the support of The Andy Thomas Centre for Space Resources, University of Adelaide and Flinders university, it is based in the realities of the space industry.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Moon, Space Cadet! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Roving Rovers</i> is a cozy exploration and <strong>resource management</strong> game where you pilot your very own lunar rover! With humanity's arrival on the horizon, you have to explore the moon's surface to find useful resources to ensure the moon is fit for human inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447240/extras/9e5fd1f4ff12dbc182da80c94a33c7e9.poster.avif?t=1787203702\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447240/extras/9e5fd1f4ff12dbc182da80c94a33c7e9.webm?t=1787203702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447240/extras/9e5fd1f4ff12dbc182da80c94a33c7e9.mp4?t=1787203702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will traverse across imported scans of the moon's surface, meaning the craters, rocks and ridges that you drive over are based on a genuine lunar landscape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customisable Rovers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across the moon in style, and own it! Your little rover is customisable, so make it your own to suit your taste. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447240/extras/5b2b748944b77ae878848ab9529751e8.poster.avif?t=1787203702\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447240/extras/5b2b748944b77ae878848ab9529751e8.webm?t=1787203702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447240/extras/5b2b748944b77ae878848ab9529751e8.mp4?t=1787203702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll need to collect and gather resources while exploring and completing missions. Every resource brings you one step closer to figuring out if the moon is going to be humanity's new home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447240/extras/d41cf034313078e41aebe768a3559b15.poster.avif?t=1787203702\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447240/extras/d41cf034313078e41aebe768a3559b15.webm?t=1787203702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447240/extras/d41cf034313078e41aebe768a3559b15.mp4?t=1787203702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration Is Key</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the Lunar landscape, and sink into the cosmic environment as you explore! Don’t leave any stone unturned, or any crater overlooked, important resources or information could be waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447240/extras/51d2118e4340d2700489e5da04effa91.poster.avif?t=1787203702\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447240/extras/51d2118e4340d2700489e5da04effa91.webm?t=1787203702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447240/extras/51d2118e4340d2700489e5da04effa91.mp4?t=1787203702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feature Summary:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep <strong>resource management</strong> systems that reward planning and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>customisable rover;</strong> parts, paint, and personality!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying <strong>collecting and gathering resources</strong> loops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-ended <strong>exploration</strong> across a vast lunar map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roving Rovers started as a replica of the internationally recognised Australian Rover Challenge, enabling players to understand the complexities of the lunar and otherworldly rover missions. Developed with the support of The Andy Thomas Centre for Space Resources, University of Adelaide and Flinders university, it is based in the realities of the space industry.</p>",
        "short_description": "Ensure the moon is safe for humanity’s lunar settlement! Explore the moon as a Lunar Rover and interact with crashed ships, natural resources, and the nearby landmarks to determine if humans can live here!",
